{"title":"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/4/81414ced90ee5723c960e8677bf115e72410e4bb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=\\frac{1^2}{1} + \\frac{2^2}{3} + \\frac{3^2}{5} +  \\; \\dots \\; + \\frac{1001^2}{2001}\\]\" width=\"261\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/6/f86575c256e324ddd1158f0937d2855e81aad62d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=\\frac{1^2}{3} + \\frac{2^2}{5} + \\frac{3^2}{7} +  \\; \\dots \\; + \\frac{1001^2}{2003}.\\]\" width=\"264\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Find the integer closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f1e01a23cc763a40bb2312f2387afafe4b5ea12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b0540347029795b1fa5377aa7933f522a9de31db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }500 \\qquad \\text{(B) }501 \\qquad \\text{(C) }999 \\qquad \\text{(D) }1000 \\qquad \\text{(E) }1001$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"442\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Start by subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and group those with a common denominator together, leaving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09a0fd235ae9181310250d7c471210f21a67a043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1^2}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"22\" height=\"41\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/1/ea1f9b19b4712fe876bc959f18da7de354ce9ec9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1001^2}{2003}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"41\" /> to the side.\n</p><p>\\begin{align*}\na-b\n&amp;=(\\frac{1^2}{1} + \\frac{2^2}{3} + \\frac{3^2}{5} +  \\; \\dots \\; + \\frac{1001^2}{2001}) - (\\frac{1^2}{3} + \\frac{2^2}{5} + \\frac{3^2}{7} +  \\; \\dots \\; + \\frac{1001^2}{2003}) \\\\\n&amp;=\\frac{(2^2-1^2)}{3}+\\frac{(3^2-2^2)}{5}+\\frac{4^2-3^2}{7} + \\; \\dots \\; + \\frac{1001^2-1000^2}{2001} + 1 - \\frac{1001^2}{2003}. \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Notice how <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/7/1e7b90adde0a581bb5bec1c3fce18c51023aeaa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2^2-1^2)}{3}=1, \\frac{(3^2-2^2)}{5}=1, \\frac{4^2-3^2}{7}=1, \\; \\dots \\;, \\frac{1001^2-1000^2}{2001}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"522\" height=\"41\" />. This is because all of these are in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/0/bb06476d0efeacec6f782769c44f42f513b055b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n^2-(n-1)^2}{2n-1}=\\frac{n^2-(n^2-2n+1)}{2n-1}=\\frac{2n-1}{2n-1}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"398\" height=\"42\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> of these terms since it begins at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/b/6cb7ae00764b56ee2adf59e78a1ffde9685b80db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and ends at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f7b886643a00cc7b51ff09475728cdd1fadfdaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1001,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/4/ec49e7df684f60217de95eaa40a4aec1d9b92155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1001-2+1=1000.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"166\" height=\"15\" /> Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5c5cf7bec9c592e53597d20348e14be572bf443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b=1000+1 - \\frac{1001^2}{2003}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"208\" height=\"41\" /> We can either manually calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/1/ea1f9b19b4712fe876bc959f18da7de354ce9ec9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1001^2}{2003}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"41\" /> or notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce352983fd5a6bb10155ed8fbec9948bae02c2ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1001^2}{2003} \\approx \\frac{1001^2}{2002}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"41\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/427a5802a257523dbd3f0cd2772237e6f1ab81b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1001^2}{2003} &lt; \\frac{1001^2}{2002}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"122\" height=\"41\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/2/472179b19e2a4917ea122ea2b8e4a19cd8a5a86d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1001^2}{2003} &gt; -\\frac{1001^2}{2002}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"155\" height=\"41\" /> Therefore,\n</p><p>\\begin{align*}\na-b\n&amp;=\\frac{(2^2-1^2)}{3}+\\frac{(3^2-2^2)}{5}+\\frac{4^2-3^2}{7} + \\; \\dots \\; + \\frac{1001^2-1000^2}{2001} + 1 - \\frac{1001^2}{2003} \\\\\n&amp;=1001-\\frac{1001^2}{2003} \\\\\n&amp;&gt;1001-\\frac{1001^2}{2002} \\\\\n&amp;=1001-\\frac{1001}{2} \\\\\n&amp;=\\frac{1001}{2} \\\\\n&amp;=500.5 \\\\\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/1/b41532f37957183a9de5c2bb79b292af31d18e9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b&gt;500.5,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" /> we can conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a697bfdeadf2105048670e6f6c7d4dc6878dc4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> is closer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/4/bd4cf10c283207e2482b3bc70a47489a0ba7fce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$501$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/c/59c5bdecc884faa4dc901a16472551503e88af64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/c/45ce5868870a324470d233259262220c1c2fcd6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 501}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In sigma notation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50d8869bc39bed8afcffa9e5e550dd8398b272c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{1001} \\frac{k^2}{2k-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"86\" height=\"56\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/5/b85a0906bfd0bca21044fdd692c3e62d196393d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{1001} \\frac{k^2}{2k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"86\" height=\"56\" /> respectively. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e2f1b866f0dbdf872a2448e50637fc66aea6558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b= \\sum_{k=1}^{1001} \\frac{k^2}{2k-1} - \\sum_{k=1}^{1001} \\frac{k^2}{2k+1} = \\sum_{k=1}^{1001} (\\frac{k^2}{2k-1} - \\frac{k^2}{2k+1})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"452\" height=\"56\" />. Combining the fractions, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/0/f704c0a5b3544a9ce3c2922bd4f8e018a56f92d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{k^2}{2k-1} - \\frac{k^2}{2k+1} = \\frac{2k^2}{4k^2-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"219\" height=\"42\" /> and this can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/902eec4e55ca11c776d300fa94b41639eb099086.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{4k^2}{4k^2-1}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{4k^2-1}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"250\" height=\"45\" />. Substituting back, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/738f9e8d699d5aaf966779f2f42ad56793cba049.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{1001}\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{4k^2-1}\\right)\\right) = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\sum_{k=1}^{1001} 1 + \\sum_{k=1}^{1001}\\left(\\frac{1}{2k-1}-\\frac{1}{2k+1}\\right)\\right)=\\frac{1001}{2}+\\frac{1001}{2003}\\approx 501$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"688\" height=\"56\" />. So, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/c/45ce5868870a324470d233259262220c1c2fcd6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 501}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" />\n~J.zz.z\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_19\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_21\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017200230\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 263/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6949/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.919      1 -total\n 61.00%    7.880      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 37.98%    4.907      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:28153:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017200230 and revision id 290019. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}